      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "However he shook off the creature into the fire, and wasn’t harmed.",
      "ko": "바울이 그 짐승을 불에 떨어버리매 조금도 상함이 없더라",
      "source_text_hash": "7bf53b592f889b8eae15c32811fc55a213c9a969fe3c8f79a23d6751323c92fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "629a3d34e903bb7dcdd5e231f5e2be47e5f67968ac4a8ea8a6eaf3f12eafb822",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "바울이 그 짐승을 불에 떨어버리매 조금도 상함이 없더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "629a3d34e903bb7dcdd5e231f5e2be47e5f67968ac4a8ea8a6eaf3f12eafb822"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ACT:28:6",
      "sequence": 27902,
      "chapter_label": "ACT 28",
      "verse_label": "6",
      "locator": {
