      "en": "Then when this was done, the rest also who had diseases in the island came and were cured.",
      "ko": "이러므로 섬 가운데 다른 병든 사람들이 와서 고침을 받고",
      "source_text_hash": "d3b7329706860b8185d06a6fae8a657864c8abcec1952eb07cdc52a63784cb3c",
      "translation_text_hash": "53393ba9bbc306fec7ed0429990aaf8831e72152355fc301e0a4c0941dff873a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
