      "en": "After three months, we set sail in a ship of Alexandria which had wintered in the island, whose figurehead was “The Twin Brothers.”",
      "ko": "석달 후에 그 섬에서 과동한 알렉산드리아 배를 우리가 타고 떠나니 그 배 기호는 디오스구로라",
      "source_text_hash": "bf3c5124beea880bd7cfb0e35aff15cc7eb805afce6643b4f40ceb3fa5d3857c",
      "translation_text_hash": "cba4fe6ab2df34d35ac064bdb58851b8a8e2c7a8695ca009b8b782538df8e773",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
