      "en": "When we entered into Rome, the centurion delivered the prisoners to the captain of the guard, but Paul was allowed to stay by himself with the soldier who guarded him.",
      "ko": "우리가 로마에 들어가니 바울은 자기를 지키는 한 군사와 함께 따로 있게 허락하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a6f41d987914ce23b3c3deb440bc2f6800a66dda8e15d446df5ca3644e66c2c8",
      "translation_text_hash": "b3fd43fa57e1a59641dfbae927532943cef642f8be61fcd2664a75cd56b7a372",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
