      ],
      "en": "Some believed the things which were spoken, and some disbelieved.",
      "ko": "그 말을 믿는 사람도 있고 믿지 아니하는 사람도 있어",
      "source_text_hash": "c62efcaf1902139c037e283f37a1407307b1d08d442721c7ef0e88fc03ea1994",
      "translation_text_hash": "4b83e2bb18fb1cac2e031509dd05a385d898a9a1c45cac97e905f0ecd4e73652",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
